      "description": "<p><strong>Hotel Overview:</strong> Paramount Hotel Dubai seamlessly blends Hollywood-inspired glamour with eco-conscious luxury. Its prime location in Business Bay makes it an architectural marvel offering breathtaking views of the Dubai skyline and a commitment to sustainable practices.</p><p><strong>Accommodations:</strong> Paramount hotel Dubai caters to a variety of travelers with its richly appointed rooms and suites. Guests can enjoy a comfortable stay in one of the 824 elegantly appointed guestrooms. The hotel offers a variety of rooms including Deluxe Rooms Grand Suites and Paramount Suites. Each room features king-size or twin beds expansive city or pool views and luxury in-room amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi 55-inch flat-screen TVs minibars stocked with gourmet snacks and premium bedding. The marble bathrooms are equipped with rain showers and exclusive toiletries.</p><p><strong>Amenities:</strong> Guests enjoy top-tier services including 24-hour concierge service valet parking private cabana rentals at the poolside a state-of-the-art business center for corporate needs and VIP services such as butler and limousine rentals.</p><p><strong>Dining Options:</strong> Paramount Hotel boasts six diverse dining venues including The Stage Restaurant offering international cuisine with live cooking stations; Craft Table that presents an artisanal farm-to-table experience; The Pacific Groove which serves Californian style dishes in a laid-back setting. Special culinary events like wine pairing dinners add to the guest experience.</p><p><strong>Nearby Location & Transportation:</strong> Located just 16 kilometers from Dubai International Airport and minutes away from the Business Bay Metro Station.</p><p><strong>Nearby Attractions:</strong></p><p><ul><li>Burj Khalifa - 5 km The worlds tallest building offering panoramic city views.</li><li>Dubai Mall - 4 km A premier shopping destination featuring over 1200 stores along with dining and entertainment options.</li></ul></p><p><strong>Wellness And Activities:</strong> The hotel features extensive wellness facilities including a luxurious spa that offers signature treatments like aromatherapy massages and hydrotherapy sessions; a fully-equipped fitness center with personal trainers available; yoga classes held in tranquil settings ensure guests maintain their wellness regime while traveling.</p><p><strong>Policies & Check-In Instructions:</strong></p><p><ul><li>Check-in is at 3 PM using government-issued photo ID. Credit card or cash deposit required on arrival.</li><li>Special requests are subject to availability upon check-in may incur additional charges.</li><li>Pet-friendly options available upon request with terms applicable.</li></ul></p><p><strong>Summary:</strong> Paramount Hotel Dubai is an exquisite blend of luxury accommodations tailored for any guest type located conveniently close to major attractions ideal for both business travelers seeking top-notch facilities combined superb dining options ensuring their stays comfortable unique memorable</p><br/><b>Disclaimer notification: Amenities are subject to availability and may be chargeable as per the hotel policy.</b>",
